  source_id "chronicle_1769443149872_49iuzu"
  title "When The Brazier Woke Again"
  summary "Vorolum~ Vigil, a Claw warrior, flees through ice tunnels beneath ☽'slew Ravium~ while carrying the sacred dagger ☽'micseleia' and fire-core supplies as orca raiders led by Gnarkzund Zaith breach their defenses. She helps courier Gold escape with critical supplies, sacrifices fellow Claw Loemus~ to buy time, and confronts Gnarkzund Zaith in the main cavern where she uses the dagger's ancient magic to defeat him with aid from hidden Claws. Vorolum~ survives with severe injuries, honors her fallen comrades by carving their names in ice, and prepares to lead the remaining survivors toward the surface routes."
